+## Step 3: Drizzle migration
+
+```bash
+cd packages/db
+npx drizzle-kit generate   # generates SQL migration
+npx drizzle-kit push       # applies to Supabase Postgres
+```
+
+Need `drizzle.config.ts` in `packages/db` pointing at `DATABASE_URL`.
